@startuml
[*] --> Start

Start --> Track Habits : User begins tracking habits
Start --> Set Goals : User sets goals for improvement

Track Habits --> Analyze Data : System analyzes tracked data
Set Goals --> Analyze Data : System analyzes progress towards goals

Analyze Data --> Provide Recommendations : Machine learning provides personalized recommendations
Provide Recommendations --> Adjust Habits : User adjusts habits based on recommendations
Provide Recommendations --> Share Habits : User shares habits with community

Adjust Habits --> Track Habits : User continues tracking adjusted habits
Share Habits --> Sense of Community : User connects with others sharing similar habits

Sense of Community --> Track Habits : User resumes tracking habits
Sense of Community --> Set Goals : User sets new goals inspired by community

Track Habits --> [*] : User exits system
Set Goals --> [*] : User exits system
@enduml
